*3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.

